  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Kasama Cooking Oil Investment Limited Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The enterprise is requesting for USADF support to enable it to expand its current business operations focusing on the following key areas: Access to and distribution of additional sunflower seed to 800 farmers over 5 years, with each farmer growing an average of 0.5 hectares; Purchase of an additional oil expeller/ filter/ roaster - including spare parts, 1,000 liter tank packaging machine, packaging containers, platform scales and protecting clothing; Purchase of 10mt metal silos to hold raw materials (sunflower); Construction of appropriate structure to accommodate processing equipment; Purchase of tractor and implements to facilitate production by farmers through tractor hire services; Access to additional crop purchase fund; Access to working capital to facilitate hire of trucks to transport raw materials from production areas to the processing facility; Access to appropriate transportation to facilitate distribution of cooking oil; Market support through branding, certification and advertising of the cooking oil; and Management and administrative support for one year</narrative>
  </description>
